    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Sinead Coughlan Estate Agent is delighted to bring to the market these 0.5-acre sites nestled just a 3-minute drive from Broadford Village in Co. Limerick.\r\nThis is truly a fantastic opportunity to build your dream home in an idyllic setting and just Priced at €65,000 each (with the option to acquire additional adjoining land). Contained within Folio # LK66891F, along excellent roadside location, these sites are sold Subject to Planning Permission – giving you the freedom to design your own new-build home. You’ll enjoy easy village access with the local National school, community creche, church, pub, restaurants, shops, post office, credit union, hair salon and much more and all on Broadford’s doorstep. The village itself also boasts unique attractions like the Broadford Arboretum and monuments to local heritage (including the poet Daithi O’Bruadair) plus scenic walking trails and a children’s playground nearby. Commuting is also a breeze with 14 minutes to Newcastle West town, 30 minutes to Charleville town and a 40 minute commute to Limerick City.\r\nThis is truly a fantastic opportunity to build your dream home in a peaceful rural setting with every amenity at hand.\r\nFor further information Call Sinead on 087-4050663."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime 0.5-acre building plots in Broadford, Co. Limerick – €65,000 each (optional extra lands available).\r\nExcellent Roadside location, Sites sold subject to planning permission, ideal for designing your own home.\r\nExcellent Roadside location, Just 3-minute drive to Broadford Village centre, with School, Community Creche, Church, Pub, Supermarket, Post Office, Credit Union, Hair Salon, Takeaways, etc. \r\nBroadford features a beautiful Arboretum of Irish trees, walking trails through the Mullaghareirk hills, a children’s playground and a Daithi O’Bruadair monument. \r\n4 minutes to Newcastle West Town, 30 mins to Charleville Town and 40 mins to Limerick City.\r\nFOLIO # LK66891F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Call Sinead for Further information- 087-4050663"
      }
    ],
